      "identity": "e59f7e5a0a3550c95a81e4e04ab3af7e6764ec4a6fd6c0828f8c606abe92b6f0"
    },
    "p12/esc894:14": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 14,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "If you can go to the mountain or big lake, I would say try spending a few hours there. Maybe have a mini picnic by yourself and enjoy the nature.",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "0bb7a54f37e7c9191d7ef6f254cb2d81b9c56becafc864d6a30c63fb3097feaa"
    },
    "p12/esc894:15": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 15,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "That is a brilliant idea,I do love walking and being outdoors. :) ",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "95e4677eace6efe9390e778c8ac81508258a15893612fc136ff3425bc6b7913d"
    },
    "p12/esc894:16": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 16,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "It surely would help me to clear my mind",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "0fdf7cf285dcb59c6239d136b054e069babbd7571b9855998ccb6782f0eea8e6"
    },
    "p12/esc894:17": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 17,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Is there anything you have wanted to do but don't have the time? I always want to learn guitar and baking. This is the best time to start that",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "32d0fbfbeaea1b84c10f1129f3d17288051253d954ffe2e9cb42acc0def0beb5"
    },
    "p12/esc894:18": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 18,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "oh yeah, I suppose I have more time now to focus on things I have always wanted to do but never kind of had time for it. I bought a high end photo camera ages ago but never really had a chance to use it properly-I guess it is time to pursue my interest in photography, and spending more time outdoors would be ideal for that!",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "61df68cf6b6c7c37e948a85e3cfb108807b210c6e278f0933d1fb3ff85f4633d"
    },
    "p12/esc894:19": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 19,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "And reading! The list of books I want to read is arm long!",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "a5528f12adc7d60fe55df39040a3eb6c4b3cc60ccb69d73ecc2a5ae9ae97a5e8"
    },
    "p12/esc894:2": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 2,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Was there anything that leads to this?",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "9a9d5d66fdce14738da27f26510f3e23373f86d36d049222d743620c65b81228"
    },
    "p12/esc894:20": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 20,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "That's the spirit! I know being treated like that feels horrible. However, I bet you have mourned enough, at the end of the day, a person treats you like that has no respect and you shouldn't waste time on them.",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "d10df91cd8080b5d6a2782da4b9667467733ab487ab2e9319c9d44aa31122068"
    },
    "p12/esc894:21": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 21,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "It's time to invest in yourself, once you become your better version, a better partner will come to you",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "cf30c8d85612dfe39a68984141f1cfa235830277dab78fa97b56b30a946597d3"
    },
    "p12/esc894:22": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 22,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "I really agree with you- I am worth more than that. It is time to move on, even when it is difficult. The sad side of it is that I probably will never know what I did wrong for things to end like that. Maybe I didn't do anything wrong. That is the question what will always stay with me and that actually is the hardest bit of it all. But... I am not going to delve into it.",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "d5ab250fac970d7b82234167d764fad2d41aa90d2d96ef283dda2523464128bd"
    },
    "p12/esc894:23": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 23,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "I feel like hitting a jackpot actually hahahaha. I will be walking off those calories I get from ice cream I have been scoffing lately.So I am having the best of both worlds ",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "f0e15321dcd5fbbe6230d5462f08e8fa71a24c6646094d0a7ee952dc5debc267"
    },
    "p12/esc894:24": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 24,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Who said you cannot have the cake and eat it all LOL",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "4c41e04ec9eb16caf763f683661991fe8b3a9d3ad728e1d945b5cf93da1ebe1e"
    },
    "p12/esc894:25": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 25,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Yes!Actually don't think you did wrong. Reflecting after a relationship is good but don't put all the blame on yourself.",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "3644077640cc9f3f1d7ba4a45db28b2e9e6b7b2223a41ddea967238bb8bc4541"
    },
    "p12/esc894:26": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 26,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "You have learned from this relationship too i believe, use that for your next one",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "f777af933a06f17fec5bd5253a802f7863e646972d57d0f204e4856375ddf54d"
    },
    "p12/esc894:27": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 27,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "I do not intend to. I am usually the kind of person who does blame oneself but I have found it is not right.",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "5ce0a84f36e7f683aa94433ea8b7ee7830ab952997b9d041bb06fa4b7e0b7067"
    },
    "p12/esc894:3": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 3,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "Not really. I thought everything was ok between us. That is why it kind of struck me.",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "97d8c888688ecd52b13595b1063ff13c0f76927d930f8b25afd558fae8cf02f9"
    },
    "p12/esc894:4": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 4,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "That's terrible and unacceptable behavior.",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "31995b2fa23127928c61ef43ed98618f4f2760ec653e55fe1e1b66aac0b133fe"
    },
    "p12/esc894:5": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 5,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "How long have you been together?",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "9ade6c9fe578d6efaad246a2899a34e1e936ea4df91275f569b2c22dee8d8bfc"
    },
    "p12/esc894:6": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 6,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "I have to agree with you-it is unacceptable, considering that he didn't give me any reasons as to why he did it. We have been together for 5 years. ",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "6e836636e5c2ee37db6467eaf4d461f200222b355b150e7993a47ec230fcb316"
    },
    "p12/esc894:7": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 7,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "That sucks. I wouldn't be able to accept either. ",
      "reported_at": "2024-06-10",
      "identity": "9715e6e271edf6deab0b3c5e3af123a773369ea7a962fbbeee55e03e9d67cc01"
    },
    "p12/esc894:8": {
      "owner_id": "p12",
      "session_id": "esc894",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 8,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "Have you talked to your friends about this?",
